"fab89b80-c976-54bf-93a4-2fa2cab8289c","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["a6303eee-de06-5383-a1f0-abbe52035b95","05ca7adb-8861-5738-8cda-11df8ca8f919","efa225f2-8604-5f22-8908-5c567b77dc0e","0ef5ffe2-b7b4-5ed6-a11c-ea99648ad89d","bd3bcb2a-e267-5966-87d5-88425ae05de2","8e572574-99a2-55de-8aed-ae6f3f6e7c08","4e905afa-36ad-562b-b005-27317bf0cb57","2b424f90-027c-5d5c-97eb-910774918ae2","aa548cfd-389d-534c-b31d-bc79d1cc33c5","5edbb640-bf6b-567f-ae3c-75f43de90832","19b9c9c2-5ca2-56d4-ad9f-7035dd576058","f0373eb0-4969-51d9-9b02-9efbdace07a3","05608937-3082-5089-ae17-30dfa5c84885","3d8e1726-4fac-5331-bf8e-5d3ece9a869b","6fef0a28-f593-553a-a895-99ff6e1d2145","fc88e08d-6b4d-53ab-8a76-2fa412d00a13","ac36e8f6-1a4e-5c77-bcb9-5d1fe0e86dc3","42336040-f9f7-5325-bc24-546930919c27","a353b550-45ee-5e8b-96a5-c3b01eca5fd3","6f3f590d-5525-5fa1-aa01-5eeda8f5d7f8","a9da0fad-2585-55bb-939e-51865bd91230","72c72a32-513c-5452-908b-c83438a5eb30","bfb702cb-2d1c-5b20-9d61-1368e8c29b2c","8a65dde6-d336-5c1b-82fd-5107b373a5c2","4eed479f-80c7-571b-b088-68b1b7af8723","065b04fb-3a7e-52db-8d4c-5b67f06744c9","71a06fce-9903-5a7a-b0bc-db74d1f4a231","ba0a9057-21c9-548b-996e-18bc6a392a2e","82c56e71-0e02-5d60-8ff8-90ffcfb5917f","63bea238-8e50-5720-9eee-720d28f49ddf"]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"ramp_earth_2.png","name":"ramp_earth_2.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":64,"height":128,"uv_width":64,"uv_height":128,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"0113253d-cd3a-5d2a-8951-46e09f711304","relative_path":"ramp_earth_2.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# ramp_earth_2\n\nEarth ramp, 2-step: one column wide, 2 columns long (along +Z, climbing toward +Z), rising 8 u (2 terrain steps of 11.25 cm).\n\n- Footprint: 1 x 2 columns (16 x 32 units, 0.45 x 0.90 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -8..8, y -2..8, z -16..16 units.\n- Texture: 64 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 8, construction_0 10, construction_33 10, construction_66 8, ruined 30 (8 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- ramp wedge: 16 x 8 x 32 (walkable slope 14.0 degrees), centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `ramp_earth_2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `ramp_earth_2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_ramp_earth_2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n"}